         IGYOS4069-I   Some suboptions specified in "TEST(ALL,SYM,SEPARATE)" are not  supported.  "ALL", "BLOCK", "PATH" and "STMT"  
                       were interpreted as "HOOK" and the "NONE" suboption was interpreted as "NOHOOK".  The "SYM" suboption is no   
                       longer required, "SYM" suboption behavior is always in effect with "TEST".                                    
                                                                                                                                     
                                                                                                                                     
         IGYOS4020-W   The "LIST" option was discarded due to option conflict resolution.  The "OFFSET" option from compiler         
                       invocation parameter took precedence.                                                                         
                                                                                                                                     
